     "body": "<p>PR <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2089\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/2089</a> </p>\n\n<p>There was mention of possibly using a URL shortening service or a DOI/Handle for this but for now I’ve just updated the URL as requested. I’m not aware of us having access to <a href=\"http://handle.net\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">handle.net</a> or being registered for DOIs. If someone else knows more, it could be useful to go that route</p>",
